      "writtenOn": "2020-12-02T16:26:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How would you feel about the PE dictating that the TCPM enter/exit BIST mode, rather than having the TCPCI code do it?  This seems like higher-level logic than we usually expect drivers to contain, and would reduce the need to duplicate the logic for when to enable/disable between TCPC drivers that don\u0027t use TCPCI",
